## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Test
    * data
        * test
            * function
				* misc
                    + player_teleport_panda_village.mcfunction
                * steps
                    > start.mcfcuntion
                * panda_village
                    > check_waechter.mcfunction
                    + misc
                        + check_waechter_interaction.mcfunction
            > start_autotest.mcfunction


